---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

export const prerender = true;

const pageTitle = "How to Find a Clothing Manufacturer | Complete Guide 2026";
const pageDescription = "Step-by-step guide to finding and vetting a clothing manufacturer for your fashion brand. Learn how to identify reliable factories and avoid scams.";
const schema = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": pageTitle,
    "description": pageDescription,
    "author": { "@id": "https://sdfltd.com/#org" },
    "publisher": { "@id": "https://sdfltd.com/#org" },
    "url": "https://sdfltd.com/insights/how-to-find-clothing-manufacturer/",
    "mainEntityOfPage": "https://sdfltd.com/insights/how-to-find-clothing-manufacturer/"
  }
];

---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} schema={schema}>

  <div class="container" style="padding: 3rem 1.5rem 5rem;">

    <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
      <p style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: #FFFFFF; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">
        <a href="/" style="color: #e00; text-decoration: none;">Home</a>
        <span style="margin: 0 0.5rem; color: #333;"> | </span>
        <a href="/insights" style="color: #aaa; text-decoration: none;">Insights</a>
        <span style="margin: 0 0.5rem; color: #333;"> | </span>
        <span style="color: #FFFFFF;">How to Find a Clothing Manufacturer</span>
      </p>
    </nav>

    <article>

      <header style="max-width: 760px; margin-bottom: 3rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #1a1a1a;">
        <span style="font-size: 0.62rem; letter-spacing: 0.25em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #e00; display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Sourcing Guide</span>
        <h1 style="font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 200; color: #fff; line-height: 1.2; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; letter-spacing: 0.01em;">
          How to Find a Clothing Manufacturer
        </h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1rem; color: #aaa; line-height: 1.9; margin: 0;">
          Finding the right clothing manufacturer is one of the most important decisions you will make for your fashion brand. The wrong factory can cause delays, quality problems, and wasted money. The right one becomes a long-term partner that helps your brand grow. This guide walks you through the process step by step.
        </p>
      </header>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">What Type of Manufacturer Do You Need?</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Before you search, know what type of production you need.</p>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">OEM manufacturers make garments using your design and tech pack. You control every detail | fabric, construction, labels. OEM is best when you have a finished design ready to produce.</p>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">ODM manufacturers design the garment for you. You choose from their existing styles and add your branding. ODM works well when you want to launch quickly without design costs.</p>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">CMT manufacturers do cut, make, and trim only. You supply the fabric, they construct the garment. CMT gives you maximum control over materials but requires you to source fabric separately.</p>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Full-package manufacturers handle everything | fabric sourcing, design, production, labels, packaging, and export documentation. This is the easiest option for first-time buyers.</p>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 3rem;">SDF Clothing offers all four: OEM, ODM, CMT, and full-package production from 300 pieces per style.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Where to Search</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Google search, industry directories, trade shows, referrals, and direct outreach are five reliable ways to find manufacturers.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">How to Verify Legitimacy</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Request current certification certificates (GOTS, BSCI, ISO 9001, OEKO-TEX), ask for a reference from a current brand, and request a factory video. Red flags: 100% upfront payment, no verifiable certifications, vague answers, no physical address.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Understanding MOQ</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">MOQ ranges from 300 to 1,000 pieces in Bangladesh. 300-piece MOQ means at least 300 pieces of one style. Low MOQ is better for new brands testing designs.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Sample Process</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Proto sample (7-14 days), fit sample, and pre-production sample. Good manufacturers make samples free or at low cost for confirmed orders.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">Questions to Ask</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Ask about MOQ, lead time, export documentation, product categories, certifications, payment terms, and quality inspection standards.</p>

      <h2 style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 400; margin: 0 0 1.25rem; color: #fff; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;">How to Place Your First Order</h2>
      <p style="color: #aaa; line-height: 1.8; font-size: 0.95rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Send design/tech pack, receive quote with FOB price, pay sample deposit, approve sample, confirm bulk order and pay 30% deposit, factory produces, quality inspection, pay 70% balance and receive shipping documents.</p>

      <div style="text-align: center; padding: 2.5rem; border: 1px solid #1a1a1a; border-top: 0.6px solid #e00; background: #050505; margin-top: 3rem;">
        <p style="color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 300;">
          Ready to find a clothing manufacturer you can trust? SDF Clothing has worked with fashion brands since 1998. Our MOQ starts from 300 pieces. We offer OEM, ODM, CMT, and full-package production from our factory in Dhaka.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact" style="display: inline-block; background: #e00; color: #fff; padding: 0.9rem 2.5rem; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.72rem; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase; transition: background 0.2s;">
          Request a Free Quote ?
        </a>
      </div>

      <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #aaa; margin-top: 1.5rem; line-height: 1.8;">
        Ready to go deeper than this step-by-step search process? Our <a href="/clothing-manufacturers" style="color: #e00; text-decoration: none;">complete clothing manufacturers guide</a> covers factory types, MOQ ranges, certifications, and sourcing methods across Bangladesh's full manufacturing landscape.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:#aaa; margin-top:0.75rem; line-height:1.85;">
        Once you've shortlisted a factory, use our free <a href="/tools/manufacturer-email-generator" style="color:#e00; text-decoration:none;">Manufacturer Email Generator</a> to write your first inquiry.
      </p>

    </article>

  </div>

    
    </BaseLayout>




